===== PRO: the expiry conflict refusal =====
issues: 1
config/config.exs schedules both AuroraMeter.Oban.CreditExpiry and AuroraMeter.Pro.Credits.Expirer.

They expire the same grants by calling the same operation, so the sweep runs twice for one result: the second run finds every grant already expired and writes nothing, but the load doubles and the run counts in telemetry stop meaning anything. AuroraMeter.Oban.validate!/1 refuses this configuration at boot, so it would fail on your next deploy rather than here.

Keep the core worker and remove the Pro entry, which is deprecated and is a shim for it. Then run this task again.


